  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 353375563,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_9_2328-2397",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2328-2397",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "心想这人间的道理真是说不清道不明了。到底骗人不对，还是诚实不对？不然为嘛几十年拿假酒骗人，却相安无事，都喝得挺美，可一旦认真起来反倒毁了？",
      "totalCount": 1819
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 353375563,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_8_2517-2547",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "2517-2547",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“你以为人家的名气全是虚的？那你是在骗自己。好好学本事吧！”",
      "totalCount": 1350
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 357972697,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_7_2058-2092",
      "chapterUid": 7,
      "range": "2058-2092",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有句话，还得跟您说。您别以为我这人心地不善，只是我立的这规矩不能改！",
      "totalCount": 1040
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 218776003,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_23_3332-3342",
      "chapterUid": 23,
      "range": "3332-3342",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "能人全都死在能耐上。",
      "totalCount": 885
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 520905092,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_4_583-685",
      "chapterUid": 4,
      "range": "583-685",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "张王李赵刘， 众生非蚁民， 定睛从中看， 人人一尊神。",
      "totalCount": 736
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 439765042,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_43_5381-5415",
      "chapterUid": 43,
      "range": "5381-5415",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人要阔得起，也得穷得起。阔不糟钱，穷就挣钱。能阔也能穷，世间自称雄。",
      "totalCount": 693
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 563402665,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_32_3589-3616",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "3589-3616",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "天津这码头太大，藏龙卧虎，站在那儿不如站在船上更踏实。",
      "totalCount": 555
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 78355268,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_60_4989-5004",
      "chapterUid": 60,
      "range": "4989-5004",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "从此，此地再无高人，亦无奇人。",
      "totalCount": 520
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 357364452,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_8_435-486",
      "chapterUid": 8,
      "range": "435-486",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "手艺人靠的是手，手上就必得有绝活。有绝活的，吃荤，亮堂，站在大街中央；没能耐的，吃素，发蔫，靠边待着。",
      "totalCount": 496
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 353375563,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_12_3318-3356",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "3318-3356",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "念书得信书。他连念书的人能耐还是不念书的人能耐都弄不清，哪还会有念书的心思？",
      "totalCount": 495
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 58501572,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_43_3056-3114",
      "chapterUid": 43,
      "range": "3056-3114",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "这世上的事很奇怪，活在天上的人掉下来好像绝了路，一直在地上的小老百姓反倒没这感觉，该吃就吃，该睡就睡，该干活就干活。",
      "totalCount": 493
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 32327422,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_48_5607-5632",
      "chapterUid": 48,
      "range": "5607-5632",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "可是他有怎样的熊心豹胆，冒多大险，才换上了这一招？",
      "totalCount": 442
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 907889584,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_13_2115-2129",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "2115-2129",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "向来看能人栽跟斗都最来神儿！",
      "totalCount": 414
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 353375563,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_10_4057-4096",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "4057-4096",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "自此，贺道台就得了“死鸟”的外号。而且人们传这外号的时候，还总附带着这个故事。",
      "totalCount": 385
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 417544967,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_14_1310-1364",
      "chapterUid": 14,
      "range": "1310-1364",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "手艺再高，东西再好，拿到生意场上必得靠人吹。三分活，七分说，死人说活了，破货变好货，买卖人的功夫大半在嘴上。",
      "totalCount": 384
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 353375563,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_17_2090-2112",
      "chapterUid": 17,
      "range": "2090-2112",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "治牙的，把全部心思都使在牙上，医术还能不高？",
      "totalCount": 377
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 75838590,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_18_508-546",
      "chapterUid": 18,
      "range": "508-546",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "此君脸窄身薄，皮黄肉干，胳膊大腿又细又长，远瞧赛几根竹竿子上晾着的一张豆皮。",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 908266510,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_12_447-482",
      "chapterUid": 12,
      "range": "447-482",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "。冯家人聪明，脑袋瓜赛粤人翁伍章雕刻的象牙球，一层套一层，每层一花样。",
      "totalCount": 360
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 81263808,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_37_426-480",
      "chapterUid": 37,
      "range": "426-480",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "人世间最吃得开的有四大样：钱、权、爹、长相。有钱通神，有权比神还顶用，有好爹就是有靠山，长相俊招得人见人爱。",
      "totalCount": 350
    },
    {
      "bookId": "28416153",
      "userVid": 426947822,
      "bookmarkId": "28416153_50_2278-2291",
      "chapterUid": 50,
      "range": "2278-2291",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "拿火烧成的东西都不怕再烧。",
      "totalCount": 336
    }
  ],
